# Sumala Sentry counts only permanents "you control". Bot2's Hauntwoods Shrieker attacks on turn 4 and manifests dread for Bot2:
# Grizzly Bears enters face down under Bot2's control. Bot1 then turns it face up with its own Shrieker's ability: it is a permanent
# Bot2 controls, so Bot1's Sentry puts no counter on it or on itself, even though Bot1 turned it up (CR 701.40b, 603.2). The Bears
# stay a 2/2, the Sentry a 1/3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Sumala Sentry
Hauntwoods Shrieker
Mox Sapphire
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Hauntwoods Shrieker
Island x5
Island
Island
Grizzly Bears
Lightning Bolt
Island x8

